<title>UK: London tea sale average price.</title>
<headline>London tea sale average price.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The weighted average for the 3,499 packages of landed tea sold at this week's London sale was 134.81 pence a kilo against 125.82 last week and 102.70 a year ago.</p>
<p>The average for the 119,846 pkgs sold so far this year is 128.22 pence against 111.37 pence for the 168,739 pkgs sold by this stage last year.</p>
</text>
